{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1000_null", "source_sha256": "6f59e19e7c660b4dec5823e83d2ed8ba50be7aa4bbd895cb7e97781655a16111", "ja": "定期公演会　3日前……", "zh": "定期公演会　3天前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1001_406gsp", "source_sha256": "d7044cbf5767491b085f2ce8b30fc0e28a3ca23df92379ea22f9d6afaf23ceed", "ja": "お疲れ。瑞希に色々聞いたよ。\nコーラスの練習、だいぶ手を焼いてるみたいだな？", "zh": "辛苦了。我听瑞希说了不少事。  \n合唱练习好像让你颇为头疼啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "d372f9c1eb3be4727c4db9c84723fc22d025c55b18cee630893504c0dfc9648c", "ja": "まぁな。でも目下の悩みは、出来が悪すぎることだ。\nもうすぐリハだってのに……。", "zh": "算是吧。不过眼下最头疼的，还是效果实在太糟糕了。\n明明彩排马上就要到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "00d083c0a348097e171fd289756d086b80ddc48ec0a3bc9f2afc9178c0aeb747", "ja": "ミズキは問題ないんだ。コーラスってものも、\nちゃんと分かってくれてる。問題は……。", "zh": "水树没问题。她也确实理解什么是合声。问题在于……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1004_406gsp", "source_sha256": "0bd3f7bf973de5f0a5ad4e16f03fc80362c641aa38e5ed1e9ff485f1ef7c2eb1", "ja": "……翼か？", "zh": "……是翼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "76b66a75593dc27cccaf3fd243d0c4fb32bed7e27b96240a5057e547d9ca41a8", "ja": "ああ。しれっと遅刻してきたかと思えば、思いきり\n歌って、すっきりして勝手に帰る……。", "zh": "嗯。还以为她只是若无其事地迟到了，没想到却放声歌唱，唱痛快了就自顾自地回去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "02fbd98115df542b20c6f42433ce1a205bb4f783ee6bb0ce61740baf96ee19fa", "ja": "それが毎日だぞ？　どうしたら真面目に参加するか\n考えちゃいるが……、もうサッパリだ。", "zh": "那可是每天都这样啊？我也在想要怎么让她认真参加……可已经完全没辙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1007_406gsp", "source_sha256": "d3b595b5e6565c720521f67541f75f0dafa57ae1250d5d39c3735f7729de5553", "ja": "真面目にか……。そうだ、翼が興味を持つ方法を\nみつければ、可能性はあるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "认真参加吗……对了，只要找到能让翼产生兴趣的方法，说不定就有可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "d8889c9a0b8603e4cb441db6242e371a63e13d363c20590b88114717eaf8fc4c", "ja": "はあ～？　そんな甘ったるいコトでいいのか？\n仮にも仕事だぞ？", "zh": "哈啊～？这么甜腻腻的办法也行吗？好歹也是工作吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1009_406gsp", "source_sha256": "4ebf1ab413c80f4cf7cb5588be94cbc8402581b7b8112e1d87f38b83bc4e2978", "ja": "でもジュリアだって「今後の仕事はスカート着用だ！」\nって言われたら、気乗りはしないだろ？", "zh": "不过，要是连茱莉亚都被告知“今后的工作都得穿裙子！”，也会提不起劲吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "86bab4006e734606ad3b043e204b7d7b13efd85a154334274d9e3cfd3d1bc471", "ja": "ぐっ……！　それは、確かに。\n想像するだけで絶望するな……。", "zh": "呃……！确实如此。\n光是想象一下就让人绝望……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "4c205cb34cd65a05d8ede26b11b955bcde9b844561156ce47933c14a4be6641e", "ja": "……。\nだから……翼に合ったやり方を見つけろって？", "zh": "……\n所以……你是说要找到适合翼的方法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1012_406gsp", "source_sha256": "b76234647775f61d79c183b78fd20c43a65260202f92ed46c1c4de3f204b8ce3", "ja": "その通り！", "zh": "没说错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "f22b9b17c46bd18377b1e35947dd13c722132711365006aa71c11dcd60d8268a", "ja": "……ふりだしに戻った。でも、そうだな。\nもう少し、頭を柔らかくしてみる。", "zh": "……又回到起点了。不过，也是啊。\n我再试着把思路放灵活一点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "c552387fabce8acbf0f7a1efc0941f26ba2a3a4e7da39c57cd651342c872fcc7", "ja": "成り行きで乗っちまった船だけど、\n今更降りるマネはしたくないからな。", "zh": "虽然是顺势上了这条船，但事到如今，我可不想装作要下船。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0513_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "354017f6de3dc1b1bcbeab9c49c7f4b3b53082566afd7ab02f83e6a38b1668b9", "ja": "あたしも向き合ってみるよ。\nただし、あたしなりの方法でな。", "zh": "我也会试着正视它。\n不过，要用我自己的方式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
